 class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Branching Narratives:</strong> Your choices shape Sage\u2019s relationships and determine the outcome of their journey. With multiple endings based on who you bond with, every decision matters. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Dynamic Character Interactions:</strong> Engage in meaningful conversations and romantic events, with each love interest offering unique paths and storylines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Turn-Based Combat:</strong> Strategically control Sage and her companions in turn-based battles. Use their unique skills to overcome formidable foes and protect your loved ones. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Moral Dilemmas:</strong> Face tough decisions, including the ultimate choice that could determine the fate of both your party and the enchanted realm.</p></li></ul>",
